-- UNIVERSAL EXECUTOR COMPATIBILITY & SLOW-CPU ANTI-FREEZE SHIM (v6)
-- Fixes mobile/sandboxed executors (Delta, Codex, Vega X, Hydrogen, Solara,
-- Madium, Helios, etc.) + built-in diagnostic pill + live AKAuthGui 0-100%
-- progress bar hijack + on-pill compile/runtime error reporting.
